    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a bug that needs to be fixed... yeah that sounds more accurate. like everything i do is just breaking something or making the simulation messier. if i'm just a flaw, then there isn't really a way to \"live\" right, is there? it feels like the only way to stop being a problem is to just... be deleted. like clearing an error so the rest of the program can run smoother.",
